  "_comment": "Dungeons recorded for Part 1: 28 across 15 regions, each with its Renown gate, expected enemy level and treasure list. Part 3 replenishes every dungeon with new chests and scaled enemies, which is recorded once under _mechanics rather than repeated on every row.",
