    "where": "Dungeons sit across the world map of the Dagdan Empire, with several in each region you visit.",
    "partOne": "In Part 1 the reachable regions are locked to your chosen path, and two dungeons lie in seas only Theodora can cross during Part 1; the other parties can sail those waters later.",
    "partThree": "In Part 3 every dungeon replenishes with new unique chests, and enemy difficulty scales with how far the story has progressed.",
    "renown": "Every dungeon carries a Renown requirement, the account-wide progression gate, so a low-Renown run cannot simply walk into the richest cave.",
    "level": "The recorded enemy level tells you what to expect: a dungeon far above your current units is a later revisit target rather than a first-visit clear."
